{"id":"n63190-1-13","stage":3,"title":"선호 · 偏爱","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63190-1-13-1","ko":"민준아, 이 두 상품 중 어떤 게 더 잘 팔릴까?","zh":"敏俊啊，这两个商品哪个会更畅销呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준아,","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"두","meaning":"两","explanation":"두：两","readings":[{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71458","senseId":"1","lemma":"두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}},{"text":"상품","meaning":"商品","explanation":"상품：商品","readings":[{"term":"상품","audio":"/audio/cd75437c97e691144222.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83175","senseId":"1","lemma":"상품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상품","audio":"/audio/cd75437c97e691144222.mp3"}},{"text":"중","meaning":"当中","explanation":"중：当中","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"1","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"哪一个","explanation":"어떤：哪一个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"2","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"事物（것 + 主格助词 이）","explanation":"게 是依存名词 것 和主格助词 이 的缩合，指前面修饰的事物、行为或情况，并把它作为主语；这里不是表示将来计划的 -ㄹ/을 것이다。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，有效地","explanation":"잘：很好地，有效地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"13","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"팔릴까?","meaning":"被卖掉，被卖出","explanation":"팔리다：被卖掉，被卖出；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"팔리다","audio":"/audio/5f104909fa8ff0fa0801.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71483","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"팔릴까","audio":"/audio/67fcb7326086f6e08de8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"dfedd225bb659d50","term":"두","zh":"两","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3","entryId":"71458","definition":"两个的。","pronunciation":["두ː"]},{"id":"cd75437c97e69114","term":"상품","zh":"商品","audio":"/audio/cd75437c97e691144222.mp3","entryId":"83175","definition":"用于买卖的东西。","pronunciation":["상품"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"当中","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"多个中。","pronunciation":["중"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"哪一个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问在现有的多个人或事物中，作为对象的是什么。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"事物、事情","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"事物、事情","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，有效地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"功能或效果让人满意地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"5f104909fa8ff0fa","term":"팔리다","zh":"被卖掉，被卖出","audio":"/audio/5f104909fa8ff0fa0801.mp3","entryId":"71483","definition":"收取钱财后，物品或权利被交给对方或劳动力等被提供。","pronunciation":["팔리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/251bc60924f2ffe443ab.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63190-1-13-2","ko":"글쎄, 소비자의 선호에 따라 다를 것 같아.","zh":"嗯，我觉得这得看消费者的喜好吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"글쎄,","meaning":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","explanation":"글쎄：也许吧，或许吧，难说","readings":[{"term":"글쎄","audio":"/audio/7ca52d3e5ceed208124e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29723","senseId":"1","lemma":"글쎄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"글쎄","audio":"/audio/7ca52d3e5ceed208124e.mp3"}},{"text":"소비자의","meaning":"消费者","explanation":"소비자：消费者；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"소비자","audio":"/audio/5eaa0c4876c201db316c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28821","senseId":"1","lemma":"소비자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소비자의","audio":"/audio/71876354dfb55bde216c.mp3"}},{"text":"선호에","meaning":"偏爱，喜好","explanation":"선호：偏爱，喜好；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"선호","audio":"/audio/2cf38479d2430bd5cd4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63190","senseId":"1","lemma":"선호","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선호에","audio":"/audio/a33c01ce9d6747614bbd.mp3"}},{"text":"따라","meaning":"按照","explanation":"따르다：按照；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"따르다","audio":"/audio/3ad4e3c6c1e70deec620.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64547","senseId":"8","lemma":"따르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따라","audio":"/audio/b3d3c74efc47a457e176.mp3"}},{"text":"다를","meaning":"不同，不一致","explanation":"다르다：不同，不一致；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"다르다","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26824","senseId":"1","lemma":"다르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다를","audio":"/audio/e38ce0cb45be4e57ff1c.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7ca52d3e5ceed208","term":"글쎄","zh":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","audio":"/audio/7ca52d3e5ceed208124e.mp3","entryId":"29723","definition":"对于对方所提出的问题或要求，表现出不确定的态度。","pronunciation":["글쎄"]},{"id":"5eaa0c4876c201db","term":"소비자","zh":"消费者","audio":"/audio/5eaa0c4876c201db316c.mp3","entryId":"28821","definition":"花钱买生产者制造的东西或服务等的人。","pronunciation":["소비자"]},{"id":"2cf38479d2430bd5","term":"선호","zh":"偏爱，喜好","audio":"/audio/2cf38479d2430bd5cd4f.mp3","entryId":"63190","definition":"在多个中间特别喜欢某个。","pronunciation":["선ː호"]},{"id":"3ad4e3c6c1e70dee","term":"따르다","zh":"按照","audio":"/audio/3ad4e3c6c1e70deec620.mp3","entryId":"64547","definition":"根据某种条件、基准或状况。","pronunciation":["따르다"]},{"id":"1db38b4e543bc73e","term":"다르다","zh":"不同，不一致","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3","entryId":"26824","definition":"两个对象相互不一样。","pronunciation":["다르다"]